## Bot API Changelog — 10.1 + 10.2 (Rich Messages era)

---

## Bot API 10.2 — July 14, 2026

New types:
  InputRichMessageMedia, InputMediaVoiceNote, InputRichBlockListItem
  21x InputRichBlock* (Paragraph, SectionHeading, Preformatted, Footer,
    Divider, MathematicalExpression, Anchor, List, BlockQuotation,
    PullQuotation, Collage, Slideshow, Table, Details, Map, Animation,
    Audio, Photo, Video, VoiceNote, Thinking)
  Community, CommunityChatAdded, CommunityChatRemoved
  BotSubscriptionUpdated

New fields:
  InputRichMessage: media, blocks
  BotCommand: is_ephemeral
  Message: receiver_user, ephemeral_message_id
  ChatFullInfo: community
  Message/Update: community_chat_added, community_chat_removed, subscription

New methods:
  editEphemeralMessageText
  editEphemeralMessageMedia
  editEphemeralMessageCaption
  editEphemeralMessageReplyMarkup
  deleteEphemeralMessage

Enhanced methods:
  receiver_user_id + callback_query_id on send methods

---

## Bot API 10.1 — June 11, 2026

New types (Rich Text — 24 RichText* subtypes):
  RichTextBold, RichTextItalic, RichTextUnderline, RichTextStrikethrough,
  RichTextSpoiler, RichTextDateTime, RichTextTextMention, RichTextSubscript,
  RichTextSuperscript, RichTextMarked, RichTextCode, RichTextCustomEmoji,
  RichTextMathematicalExpression, RichTextUrl, RichTextEmailAddress,
  RichTextPhoneNumber, RichTextBankCardNumber, RichTextMention,
  RichTextHashtag, RichTextCashtag, RichTextBotCommand, RichTextAnchor,
  RichTextAnchorLink, RichTextReference, RichTextReferenceLink

New types (Rich Block — 21 RichBlock* subtypes):
  RichBlockParagraph, RichBlockSectionHeading, RichBlockPreformatted,
  RichBlockFooter, RichBlockDivider, RichBlockMathematicalExpression,
  RichBlockAnchor, RichBlockList, RichBlockBlockQuotation,
  RichBlockPullQuotation, RichBlockCollage, RichBlockSlideshow,
  RichBlockTable, RichBlockDetails, RichBlockMap, RichBlockAnimation,
  RichBlockAudio, RichBlockPhoto, RichBlockVideo, RichBlockVoiceNote,
  RichBlockThinking

Container types:
  RichText, RichBlock, RichMessage, RichBlockCaption, RichBlockTableCell,
  RichBlockListItem, InputRichMessage, InputRichMessageContent

New types (Guest mode):
  SentGuestMessage

New types (Polls):
  PollMedia, InputMediaLink, InputPollMedia, InputPollOptionMedia

New methods:
  sendRichMessage
  sendRichMessageDraft
  answerGuestQuery
  answerChatJoinRequestQuery
  sendChatJoinRequestWebApp

New fields:
  Message: rich_message
  User: supports_guest_queries, supports_join_request_queries
  ChatFullInfo: guard_bot
  Poll: media, explanation_media
  PollOption: media
  ChatJoinRequest: query_id
  Message: guest_bot_caller_user, guest_bot_caller_chat, guest_query_id
  Update: guest_message

Enhanced methods:
  editMessageText: rich_message parameter

---

## Key takeaways for TPR

1. Rich messages are TWO APIs: blocks (structured) and html/markdown (text).
   Use blocks for programmatic construction, html for simple cases.
2. Streaming = sendRichMessageDraft (30s TTL) → sendRichMessage (persist).
   Plain text streaming = sendMessageDraft → sendMessage.
3. InputRichBlockThinking is DRAFT-ONLY — shows AI reasoning, cannot persist.
4. Ephemeral messages = visible to one user only. Good for auth/config flows.
5. Communities = groups of chats. New in 10.2. Watch this space.
6. Guest mode = bots answering queries from users who haven't started them.

:: ∎
